TITLE "Chromagraph approx v2_bright"
# Approximate Chromagraph film-print look, v2 with shadows lifted 0.75 stop, white fixed.
# Fitted from public stock-iPhone vs Chromagraph photo pairs by fit/fit_look.py. Approximation only; see report.md.
